WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.660
Carmichael: Landed on the ground.

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.540
Niko: [laughing] All right.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:12.200
[Obie's claws clacking]

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:16.820
Sam: We went to Little Tokyo to do a quick little test, see how to hide Waldo.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:19.420
S: He hid well, but every single person looked at us.

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:22.540
S: Specifically, every single person looked at Wren in a Waldo costume.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.040
Wren: Yeah.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.620
S: Everyone was coming up saying, "Ayy, Waldo! I found ya!"

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:26.580
S: Everyone.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.120
W: No-one really understands just how well-known Waldo is.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:31.600
W: Havin' issues.

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:37.020
W: For whatever reason, the top view was out of sync by, like, fifteen seconds.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.860
S: Can you just manually sync the top one?

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:41.680
W: ...Yeah.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.580
[Keyboard tap]
SFX: Muted whoosh

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:44.400
W:

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:48.480
W: Compared to everything that I've got in so far, this is actually really solid.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.120
W: I'm behind this watermark.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:53.900
S: It's pretty good.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.620
W: Literally, you just lift up the entire rig, and just, like, spin it in a circle.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:58.740
S: Wow, jeez.

00:00:58.820 --> 00:00:59.600
W: Yeah, it's weird, yeah.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.920
Jake: Waldo wears brown boots.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.280
W: I honestly don't think the shoes are that big of a deal.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.480
J: I don't understand why this is even a conversation.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:09.920
S: Look - Wren's fine with the shoes. No-one's gonna say, "Hey, hold on."

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:12.800
S: "...That's not Waldo."

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:16.420
Brandon: Where's your [CENSORED] brown boots?

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.020
W: [laughing] I see what you did there.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.460
B: No, Waldo has brown boots.

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:23.240
W: Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:24.700
S: Hold on.

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:30.120
W: All right.

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:30.660
S: Sucks for you.

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:31.520
W: We just locked it!

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:33.000
S: I know, 'cause the boots are on Jake's feet.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.000
C: [laughing]

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.720
N: So whenever we go into video that requires us to do pretty, like, extreme guerrilla shooting,

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:42.240
N: ...especially when it's, like, interacting with the public as, like, FBI agents, I always get a little anxious.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:46.240
N: Get a little worried that somebody's gonna think I'm, like, about to assault them or, like, blow up a bomb or something like that.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:51.940
S: Cross the street, you walk through there and you walk up the square.

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:55.580
S: Then we're screwed.

00:01:55.940 --> 00:02:02.660
SFX: Dramatic chord

